    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45628" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφέδρ-ᾰνον</span></b> , τό,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>that on which one
			sits</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἷον ἐ. γλουτός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					493a23
				</span></i>
			: pl., <i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
				<u>Onom.</u>
				116
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				2.184
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>seat</i>, <i><span class="en">
